{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our cytarabine supply to a plant classified VAI 693 days before the 2021 shortage posting; the drug is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "D11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cytarabine is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2021-09-24 that has since been resolved.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1110628 at Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3009056604) ended 2019-11-01 and was classified VAI, 693 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2021-09-24.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's VAI classification letter for that inspection is dated 2019-12-10, 654 days before the 2021-09-24 posting.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier FDA inspections at the same plant (848025 and 936901) were also classified VAI, with classification letters dated 2014-03-21 and 2016-11-01 respectively.",
      "cites": ["D8", "D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A current label for cytarabine 100 mg/mL, 20 mL vial (NDC 25021022320) names GLAND as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another label for cytarabine 20 mg/mL (NDC 68083034305) names Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3009056604) as a registered plant with a last inspection classified NAI on 2023-07-28.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 16 vials of 100 mg/mL, 20 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East's supply from 8.7 days to 14 days while Corvale General retains 19 days.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
